*==============================================================================*
* TIMES.jl reference harness hook (not part of TIMES).
* Included by main_ext.mod for stage coef_ext when 'TJLREF' is passed to
* initmty.mod, i.e. right after coefmain and the standard extensions' coef_ext
* (maindrv.mod L72-73, v4.9.7), before variables and equations are declared.
* Dumps every symbol so TIMES.jl can be checked against GAMS coefficients.
*==============================================================================*
$IF NOT SET TJL_NODUMP execute_unload 'tjl_coef.gdx';
